I open the door to the street.
I step outside.
It is raining a lot.
It is bad weather today.
It is not getting better today.
I have an umbrella in my hand.
I open the umbrella.
There are large puddles on the sidewalk.
I walk around the large puddles.
I have my winter boots on.
The rain splashes down onto the boots.
It is a very wet morning.
I walk over to the bus stop.
I always take the bus to work.
It is cold out here in the rain.
Fortunately, it gets warm inside the bus.
